            "title": "Monarch Casino & Resort (MCRI): $28.6M One-Off Loss Lowers Margins, Reinforcing Steady Value Narrative",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Monarch Casino & Resort (MCRI) reported net profit margins of 15.3% for the latest period, falling short of last year\u2019s 16.8% margin, as a one-off loss of $28.6 million weighed on results. Over the past five years, annual earnings grew by a robust 14%. The outlook now calls for a more modest 9.6% growth rate, which trails the broader US market\u2019s 15.5% forecast. Investors may see Monarch\u2019s shares as attractively valued, with a price-to-earnings ratio of 20.6x coming in well below sector...",
